From 5a8be2c9ea162074de1b280235af4bee49551746 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:21:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): show selection in the operation source dropdown

Show the saved face or edge selection in the source dropdown.
Move the header controls to a module below the file size limit.
Pin source labels and history with the real UI harness.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2982
